ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Imposible! ¿Eres tú, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Ni en sueños pensaba que me iba
a encontrar contigo, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Non è possibile! Sei tu, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Non mi sarei mai sognata di
incontrarti così, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}He, bist du das, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hätte ich mir nie träumen lassen,
dass ich dich hier treffe!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Yok artık! Sen misin, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Seninle burada karşılaşacağımı rüyamda görsem
inanmazdım, dostum! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
